{{!
    @template local_groupdist/audit_members

    One window of participants of an audit run section, as a list of its own:
    a group longer than one window ends up carrying several such lists, which
    is what lets a window be appended without re-rendering the ones already on
    screen. Each row shows the name (linked to
    the profile in a new tab when there is an account to reach), the write
    outcome and the collapsed "why here?" explanation. Rendered server-side
    for the first window and by the audit AMD module for every window loaded
    after it, so both paths produce identical markup.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * members - array of entries: name, removed, profileurl (empty when the
      participant has no reachable profile), groupname, outcome (label,
      class) and why (array of text, muted, warn)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "members": [
            {
                "name": "Ana Souza",
                "removed": false,
                "profileurl": "https://example.com/user/view.php?id=7&course=2",
                "groupname": "Group 01",
                "outcome": {"label": "written", "class": "success"},
                "why": [
                    {"text": "Rule 1 - Keep together - City: value \"Fortaleza\" - placed with 3 more.", "muted": false, "warn": false}
                ]
            },
            {
                "name": "Removed participant",
                "removed": true,
                "profileurl": "",
                "groupname": "Group 01",
                "outcome": {"label": "written", "class": "success"},
                "why": [
                    {"text": "No rule constrained this participant.", "muted": true, "warn": false}
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
    {{#members}}
    <li class="border-top py-1 local-groupdist-auditmember">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa fa-user-circle-o text-muted" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            {{#profileurl}}
            <a href="{{profileurl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{name}}<span
                class="visually-hidden"> {{#str}} opensinnewwindowbracketed, core {{/str}}</span></a>
            {{/profileurl}}
            {{^profileurl}}
            <span {{#removed}}class="fst-italic text-muted"{{/removed}}>{{name}}</span>
            {{/profileurl}}
            <span class="ms-auto badge text-bg-{{outcome.class}} fw-normal">{{outcome.label}}</span>
        </div>
        <details class="small local-groupdist-auditdisclosure">
            <summary>{{#str}} auditwhy, local_groupdist {{/str}}<span class="visually-hidden"> {{name}}</span></summary>
            <ul class="mb-1 mt-1 local-groupdist-auditwhy">
                {{#why}}
                <li class="{{#muted}}text-muted{{/muted}}{{#warn}}text-danger{{/warn}}">{{text}}</li>
                {{/why}}
            </ul>
        </details>
    </li>
    {{/members}}
</ul>
